  "abstract": "Base factorized-loadings oscillatory SSM (k=320,p=32) with temporal gating and residual copy. Sweep \u03b3_end to 0.985 to softly temper late-horizon factor magnitude. Trained with MAE+temporal curvature and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
